/#87AFFF]capture_global_destination_anywhere.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]bob-cli-13[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/bobs-org/bob-cli--beads/blob/main/pages/bob-cli-13/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Position-free @@ declarations in the capture grammar[/bold #D7AFFF]          [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]grammar[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]grammar: make any `@@…` token a global destination declaration anywhere [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]in a draft, drop the header-line-only restriction, add [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]duplicate-declaration and shadowed-local diagnostics, and update [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]capture, capture-parse, capture-complete, help text, docs, and tests.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]bob capture-rewrite and the bare @@ absorption rule[/bold #D7AFFF]           [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]rewrite[dim] · [dim][/dim]after grammar[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]rewrite: add the `bob capture-rewrite` subcommand that turns a bare `@@`[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]into `@@<payload>` by absorbing the item's local destination marker (or [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the draft's other declaration), deleting the source token and returning [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]edits, cursor, and a human summary.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Mac capture panel absorbs @@ as you type[/bold #D7AFFF]                      [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]macapp[dim] · [dim][/dim]after rewrite[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]macapp: wire the bob-mac-capture panel to `bob capture-rewrite` so [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]typing a bare `@@` rewrites the draft in place with an announced [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]summary, plus CaptureCore models, process-client lane, tests, and README[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]updates.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"bob-cli-13","llm_provider":"codex","model":"gpt-5.5","patch_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","phase_bead_id":"bob-cli-13.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-d5e3e48423a3a3098a65be4a893c048c","started_at":"2026-08-24T19:03:20.501723+00:00","state":"completed"},{"commits":[{"committed_at":1787602436,"sha":"164ae386b3e06e57a7a6387cfca9ba66fb06ab8b","subject":"docs(capture): fix the capture-rewrite help examples and A5 list"}],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"commits":{"digest":"0538614cf79778b38f9e11dcf241846aff75c4e5895c6b7b26e5684be5fd83d4","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-13.land/commits.json","size_bytes":242},"embedded_workflows":{"digest":"3942241a63c5de53df93bede886ed35a51f8b6a33d5883d819c898d7dd34f408","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-13.land/embedded_workflows.json","size_bytes":83},"meta":{"digest":"3b999b1dd23172a1cfafa42d4af5e256c369fcaaf71627c9c33947532bb49530","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-13.land/meta.json","size_bytes":637},"prompt":{"digest":"9c6ab7d2410af5f381bebdc64fea42ba4e4471a4279e34816ec042a4ac49318d","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-13.land/prompt.md","size_bytes":221},"prompt_steps":{"digest":"0b906a3b006cbb5d4c1d228310f8d539c29f667a8777000515ac5528b4ac4d62","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-13.land/prompt_steps.json","size_bytes":4194},"state":{"digest":"2d47b29f8e58ee6c823d7bdf7a5dff57366413071be7d940374f2d578ecdc0ee","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-13.land/state.json","size_bytes":180}},"finished_at":null,"global_name":"bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-13.land","local_name":"bob-cli-13.land","metadata":{"agent_clan":"bob-cli-13","agent_clan_generation":"20260824150210","approve":true,"bead_id":"bob-cli-13","changespec_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","cl_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead